#: data/io.github.dprietob.redux.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid ""
"Redux is a simple and fast batch image converter that makes your photos "
"lighter: convert them to WebP, JPEG or PNG, shrink them, rename them and "
"clean up their metadata, all in one go."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dprietob.redux.metainfo.xml.in:21
msgid ""
"Pick a set of images, choose the output format, quality and size, and "
"convert them all at once. When it finishes, Redux shows how much space you "
"saved."
msgstr ""

